# Fix Fee Collection & Due Management Loopholes — Nursing College

After thorough audit of the fee collection ([fees.tsx](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/college/fees.tsx)), due tracking ([fee-dues.tsx](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/college/fee-dues.tsx)), server routes ([nursing.ts](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts)), and DB schema ([schema.ts](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/db/schema.ts)), here are all the identified loopholes and the planned fixes.

---

## Identified Loopholes

### 🔴 CRITICAL — Server-Side Validation Gaps (money at risk)

| # | Loophole | Impact | Location |
|---|----------|--------|----------|
| 1 | **No overpayment guard** — Server accepts any `amount > 0` without checking if the student actually owes that much. A fee of ₹10,00,000 could be recorded for a student who owes ₹0. | Financial misreporting, inflated collections | [nursing.ts:1078-1115](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1078-L1115) |
| 2 | **No duplicate payment detection** — No check for duplicate fee payments (same student, same components, same date). Double-clicking or retrying can create duplicate transactions. | Double-charged students, inflated revenue | [nursing.ts:1078-1115](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1078-L1115) |
| 3 | **Discount amount has no cap** — Discount can exceed the gross subtotal (e.g., ₹50,000 discount on ₹30,000 fee), resulting in a ₹0 or negative net amount that still creates a "paid" transaction | Phantom transactions, data corruption | [nursing.ts:1086](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1086), [fees.tsx:606-654](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/college/fees.tsx#L606-L654) |
| 4 | **No student status check at payment** — Fee can be recorded for students with `status = 'inactive'`, `'suspended'`, or `'graduated'`. Only active students should have fees collected. | Payments against non-enrolled students | [nursing.ts:1078](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1078) |
| 5 | **Future-dated payments accepted without limit** — Payment date can be set far into the future (2035+), creating phantom future revenue | Misleading financial reports | [nursing.ts:1088](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1088) |
| 6 | **Amount field manually editable in UI** — The installment amount input can be freely overridden to any value (even ₹0 or ₹999999), bypassing the fee structure entirely | Collection of wrong amounts | [fees.tsx:801-808](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/college/fees.tsx#L801-L808) |
| 7 | **No discount reason enforcement** — When discount > 0, the reason field is labeled as "*" required but has NO actual validation. Empty reason accepted. | Untraceable concessions, audit risk | [fees.tsx:848](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/src/routes/_authenticated/college/fees.tsx#L848), [nursing.ts:1078-1091](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1078-L1091) |

### 🟡 IMPORTANT — Due Tracking & Calculation Issues

| # | Loophole | Impact | Location |
|---|----------|--------|----------|
| 8 | **Inactive/suspended students shown as "overdue"** — Due dashboard includes ALL students regardless of status, so dropped-out students appear as having overdue fees | False overdue counts, inaccurate KPIs | [nursing.ts:1707-1721](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1707-L1721) |
| 9 | **Hardcoded fallback fee (₹125,000)** — When no fee structure is found, a hardcoded `125000` is used as the annual fee, creating phantom dues for students with no fee structure | Students shown as owing money they don't | [nursing.ts:1752](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1752) |
| 10 | **Discount amounts not factored into due calculations** — The due dashboard sums `totalFee` from the fee structure and `paidAmount` from transactions, but discounts/concessions are deducted from the paid amount, not from the expected amount. A student with ₹10,000 discount still shows ₹10,000 as owed. | Students always shown as having a balance even when squared up | [nursing.ts:1760-1763](file:///d:/dev/acme/acme-erp/server/routes/nursing.ts#L1760-L1763) |
| 11 | **No "paid" status update on student record** — Even after a student pays 100% of their fees, there's no status indicator on the student itself. The only way to know is the dashboard calculation. | No quick status visibility | Various |

